  "color_principle": "Classification axes (repo, ai) use one flat color each so the axis is recognizable at a glance. Gradient axes (safety, status) use a per-step severity/lifecycle ramp. council uses a teal family. No two different meanings share the same exact color, except intentional within-axis sharing (repo:*, ai:*, knowledge:adr/pattern).",
